text = "Controls:

2D Platformer:
- Walk - A,D, Left Arrow, Right Arrow
- Jump - W, Up Arrow, Space

3D Platformer:
- Walk - WASD
- Jump - Space

Top Down Shooter:
- Walk - WASD
- Shoot - Left Click

Rhythm Game:
- Hit Note - Arrow Keys
"

