text = "Tips:

Platformers:

- You have a double jump
-Jump on Sproings' heads to kill them
-Dont Touch Spikes

Top Down Shooter:

-Shoot the Buggies to get XP
- Get 100% XP to level up
-You win after level 3

Rhythm Game:
- Hit the notes with the arrow key shown
"
